  "safety_constraints": [
    "An ICD-10 code alone does not prove an active emergency.",
    "Do not infer an ICD-10 code that is not explicitly in the source document.",
    "No match means no alert detected, not proof of safety.",
    "Uncertain or contradictory high-risk findings require human review.",
    "Do not map candidate clinical alerts directly to Manchester categories.",
    "Document priority and clinical urgency must remain separate until validated mapping to backend schema.",
    "Psychosocial risk flags trigger confidential human review and locally approved safeguarding pathways; they do not establish criminal facts.",
    "Do not suppress suspected abuse, suicidal ideation or violence merely because confirmation is pending.",
    "Adolescent pregnancy, parenting difficulties and harmful substance use do not alone prove immediate clinical emergency.",
    "Limit sensitive evidence exposure and follow applicable confidentiality and reporting obligations."
